# Design exports (Stitch)

Source of truth for UI before implementation. **HTML + PNG** are references; apps are built in Flutter (mobile) and Next.js (web).

## Folders

| Path | Stitch project | App |
|------|----------------|-----|
| `mobile-creator/` | [14653254409083074276](https://stitch.withgoogle.com/projects/14653254409083074276) | Flutter |
| `web-brand/` | [1425801701065968675](https://stitch.withgoogle.com/projects/1425801701065968675) | Next.js |

## Manifests

- `manifest.json` — index (both projects)
- `manifest-mobile.json` — per-screen file list (creator)
- `manifest-brand.json` — per-screen file list (brand)

## Re-export

```powershell
$env:STITCH_API_KEY = "your-key"
.\scripts\export-stitch-project.ps1 -ProjectId "14653254409083074276" -Target mobile-creator -ManifestFile design\stitch\manifest-mobile.json
.\scripts\export-stitch-project.ps1 -ProjectId "1425801701065968675" -Target web-brand -ManifestFile design\stitch\manifest-brand.json
```

Brand prompt library (for new screens): `BRAND_WEB_STITCH_PROMPTS.md`

Archived Figma PNGs (baseline only): `design/archive/figma-screenshots/`
